WEBVTT

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:36.060
Visual confirmation. Are we
communicating with the ship?

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:37.900
No response yet.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:42.300
Proceed with the investigation
using standard protocols.

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:05.580
I'm Kanzato from the Ayanagi Police.

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:31.140
I don't see anyone in here.

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:33.580
Me neither...

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:36.050
Bring the ladder!

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:40.650
Please remain outside to preserve the scene.

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:55.040
Are you there?

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:14.460
Kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:16.660
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:20.730
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.700
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:24.570
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:26.840
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:30.710
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:35.070
hurueru sora
Quaking sky

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:40.610
kazewa naniwo tsugeru
What is the wind telling me?

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:46.630
Tadashii datoka soujanai toka
Right or wrong

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:49.660
kudaranai ronsouwa
Nonsensical arguments

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:52.230
kieya shinai kedo
Never go away

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:56.800
shinjita kotowo shinjinuku koto
Believe what you believe in

00:02:56.800 --> 00:03:00.010
sono sakini bokurawa
At the end of it all

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:02.380
hikari mitsukeru darou
We will find the light

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:07.620
saa tokihanate ima
Now is the time to release it

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:10.590
kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.820
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:17.260
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.030
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:20.760
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.960
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:27.090
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:51.550
Damn, that scared me.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.460
Again?

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:54.660
Wh-what do you mean?

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:55.630
Your jerking awake.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:58.160
That was the third time since
we've been on the airplane.

00:03:58.300 --> 00:03:59.390
Really?

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:03.770
I was fighting for my life in
my dream... and I almost lost.

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:06.710
The dream where you "transform?"

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:09.940
Transform? No, it feels more like...

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:11.640
Something comes... out of me?

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:14.480
Don't ask me. I wouldn't know.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.450
I bet you're just tired.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:22.420
We did decide to move at the
last minute. The packing was...

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:24.560
You didn't have to do all this.

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:29.800
But Auntie finally got a boyfriend. We
would get in her way of dating him.

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:32.170
I really want it to work out for her. Plus...

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:33.690
That's not what I meant.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.010
I left him a message saying we'll be here today.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:47.110
This airport is new...

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.050
He's not gonna answer.

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:51.590
You're calling the house, aren't you?

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:53.620
But, I don't know his cellphone number.

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:59.220
Someone with a lot of responsibilities like
him can't just leave work anytime he wants.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.950
Even some idols get to be the
chief of a police station, though.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:06.100
That's just for show.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:07.900
You know...

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:12.140
It's been ten years. A chief has
people working under him, right?

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.210
He should be able to make time...

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:18.410
I hear he ends up dealing with lots of trivial things.

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:21.680
The three of us are the only family we've got.

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:24.450
A family who doesn't know each
other's cellphone numbers.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.660
Shin-niichan.

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:31.120
Are you getting hungry?

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:35.060
Yeah. I went there.

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:41.070
Three of the crew went missing
during an underwater research dive.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:44.670
They said the hatch shouldn't have
opened due to the water pressure.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:48.940
It's incomprehensible, but I'm uncertain
about any connection with the Reverse cases.

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:50.570
And the press?

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:53.410
We're treating it the same as a Reverse case.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:57.720
Are the Reverse cases related to that "list?"

00:05:57.720 --> 00:06:00.020
There's no guarantee yet.

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:05.930
I'll take the remaining people on the
list into custody as soon as possible.

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:10.690
Good idea. We can't lose any
more valuable "A Latents."

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:13.660
I'll get back to you again.

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.560
Nikaido Eiko

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.010
Hello.

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:22.640
It's me. I finished the autopsy of another Reverse.

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:33.480
This is the third one.

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:36.610
They're turned perfectly inside-out
like worn and discarded clothes.

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:40.420
How could this happen to a human?

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:44.390
This one's no different from the last two.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:47.260
You can see the details on my report.

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:54.540
They were only high schoolers...

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:59.240
Speaking of, Shin-kun is in high school now, right?

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:02.650
Are both of them doing well?

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:03.640
...Yeah.

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:19.600
I remember the house being bigger.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.690
Because you were smaller.

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:23.870
I see...

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:29.440
Kanzato

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:30.170
Kanzato
Ryo, Shin, Jun, Yuki

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:37.850
Huh?

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.110
That's weird.

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:45.190
He changed it...

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:56.400
Shin-niichan!

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:59.110
The forest is still here.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:43.580
Isn't that the tree you fell from?

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:45.280
...Good memory, Jun.

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:47.610
Well, it was a big deal.

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:50.630
No, what happened with Yuki was a big deal.

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:53.430
She climbed to the top on her own and...

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:56.020
...started crying because she couldn't get down.

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:00.700
She was heavier than I expected...

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:05.430
I'm sorry.

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:10.370
I'm apologizing on my twin's behalf.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.890
Now that I think about it...

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:24.050
I never played with aniki here.

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:27.700
He never hung out with me.

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.860
You just don't remember.

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:32.730
He was quite protective of you.

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:43.640
Ayanagi Police Station
Toyama Prefecture

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.220
Okazaki Takashi
Tasaka Yumi

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:00.890
Hello.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.230
Chief!

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:04.320
Katayama. What do you need?

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:15.240
Try calling his name.

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:19.680
Katayama-san, Katayama-san.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:21.840
Katayama-san, can you hear us?

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:47.040
Narasaki. Is that the victim's?

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.180
Oh... Yes.

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:49.240
Let me see.

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:52.610
But, sir... anything related to Reverse
cases should be directly reported to...

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:53.980
Just show it to me.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:11:00.250
Okazaki Takashi

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:00.990
Chief's orders... secret authorities.

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:05.890
They use my subordinates without consent
and even made two of them lifeless.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.760
How can I just sit and watch?

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:09.500
Lifeless?

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:11.360
It's just the Apathy Syndrome, right?

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:17.830
Chief.

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:19.930
The victim's possessions.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:25.140
Check up on the other one in custody.

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:33.790
That's weird...

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:34.890
What is it?

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:37.590
Neither of the people in charge are answering.

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:40.620
I know they've already gotten Tasaka Yumi...

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.990
Why are you nervous now?

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:13.060
Well, you know.

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:16.050
I feel like we missed our opportunity.

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:19.200
Now it'll be more awkward...

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:22.840
I have to think of what to say when I see him.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:27.740
I don't think nervous people can clear
extra large plates of food like that.

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:30.010
I got nervous after I finished eating.

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:33.740
Can I order dessert, too?

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:36.080
Yeah. I want a mont blanc.

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:37.980
You low-life!

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:59.030
Yeah. I should yell at aniki, too.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:04.850
If he couldn't pick us up, he should've
at least left the house unlocked.

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:06.310
Is that?

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:09.940
From your dreams on the airplane?

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:11.950
Oh, yeah...

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:14.450
This thing killed me.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:33.940
It'll be quick.

00:13:33.940 --> 00:13:36.100
I'll be gentle.

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:12.380
What's all this?

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:15.580
How many cops are there? I mean...

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:43.970
Shit.

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:40.130
Chief!

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:42.140
I'm taking her to the hospital.

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:45.470
I'm worried about the others.
Can you check the room?

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:47.770
Tell me what's going on first.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:50.570
Go and check the room first.

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:57.690
Shin-niichan, is that?

00:15:57.690 --> 00:15:59.740
Yeah, a fortune teller.

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:01.650
In such a place...

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:03.520
We should go try it.

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:05.750
No way. We'll get ripped off.

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:18.330
We meet again.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:28.350
We met once in a velvet room between
the conscious and unconscious domains.

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:31.810
U-um, this place is kind of...

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:33.650
As of now...

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:41.290
The dormant potentials of others are
being pilfered and tomorrow is ending.

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:46.600
You... have already awoken.

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:59.070
What are you doing here?

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:03.210
Niichan...

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:04.320
Ryo-niichan...

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:05.840
Why didn't you look here?

00:17:08.890 --> 00:17:11.430
Well, sure...

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:14.260
but that's not all we need to unlock it.

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:16.760
You should know the combination.

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:22.960
My birthday if it's four digits. Yours
if it's three and Jun's if it's two.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.370
This one is a combination...

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:27.000
You mean, mine and Yuki's, right?

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:29.780
Yeah... You're right.

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:40.280
Your stuff is in your rooms.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.450
Dinner?

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:45.790
We already ate.

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:48.460
You know how to use the bath, right?

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:51.020
If it's the same as it used to be.

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:53.230
I didn't put a lock on it or anything.

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:20.080
What's with his attitude?

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:22.690
It's been ten years...

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:27.970
He could've said something like, "long
time no see!" or "you've grown so much!"

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:29.940
Or "I missed you guys..."

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:33.540
I wonder if he's just being shy?

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:53.260
Jun?

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:55.430
Hey, you could've knocked.

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:58.690
Sorry... I'm gonna take off for a little bit.

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:00.460
Right now?

00:19:00.770 --> 00:19:03.040
You're starting school tomorrow.

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.040
You should shower and get ready for bed soon.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:06.300
Where are you going?

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:09.340
Knock? We're brothers, though...

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:12.470
I see. He must be...

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:17.320
I need to talk with you both.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:18.650
Can it wait?

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:20.790
I'm going to the store.

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:21.560
It's far.

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:23.060
I'll try to make it quick.

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:26.420
We waited a long time for you, so this is fine, right?

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:29.950
He's got school, too, you know?

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:32.800
Yeah, that's true.

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:35.870
We're the one that wakes him up every morning.

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:37.800
We should leave him alone tomorrow.

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:40.140
Yeah, until the very last minute.

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:56.310
A dream? But Jun was there, too.

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.770
I-It hurts...

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:26.750
U-um, are you all ri-!?

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:36.060
Wha...what's wrong with you!?

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:31.840
...It's gone.

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:54.040
Omotai kusariwo
The heavy chain

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:59.850
ima hazushite agemashou
I will take it off for you

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:05.250
jiyuuni naretara
Once you're free

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:12.130
kokowo habataite yukeruwa
You'll be able to fly away

00:22:12.130 --> 00:22:18.700
atashiga samatage
I stood in your way

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:27.710
ubatte kita madaminu sekai e
and took that world you haven't seen

00:22:27.710 --> 00:22:31.750
tamerau nonara
If you're going to hesitate

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:40.390
huriharatte ageru sono udewo
I will free that arm for you

00:22:40.390 --> 00:22:44.990
soshite tookue
Then to faraway

00:22:44.990 --> 00:22:51.160
dekirudake tookue
As far away as possible

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:54.500
aishiteruno
"I love you"

00:22:54.500 --> 00:22:58.140
ikanaideyo
"Don't leave me"

00:22:58.140 --> 00:23:05.140
koware chaukara
I will break

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:17.290
The calm of time's flow.

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:19.730
The silence of snowfall.

00:23:19.730 --> 00:23:23.160
Irregularities piercing the dark night.

00:23:23.430 --> 00:23:27.800
Another mask that found a body.

00:23:28.840 --> 00:23:32.460
Children dancing with the spell.

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:40.670
One last night of innocence
before falling into cruel reality.
